{{#> layout}}
<h1 style="margin:0 0 16px 0;font-size:24px;line-height:1.3;color:#1E2A3E;">Your email address was changed</h1>
<p style="margin:0 0 16px 0;">Your {{brandName}} account now signs in with a new email address. We will not send messages to this address anymore.</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 16px 0;">Was this not you? Please contact the person who runs {{brandName}} for your family right away, so they can protect your account.</p>
<p style="margin:24px 0;text-align:center;"><a href="{{loginUrl}}" style="display:inline-block;padding:14px 28px;background-color:#F7C600;color:#1B1B1B;font-weight:800;text-decoration:none;border-radius:999px;border:2px solid #8F6F00;">Go to sign in</a></p>
<p style="margin:0 0 16px 0;">If it was you, everything is fine and there is nothing else to do.</p>
{{/layout}}
